<p>While in your spectral form from Ghost Walk and for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns afterwards, damage and detrimental effects have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9%, 15%, 19%, 22%, 24%</acronym> chance to harmlessly pass through you.</p>